        {
          "nodeId": "n_w3_02a_mia",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "tier": "free",
          "text": "Mia 门口。旧 T 恤领口扯大，锁骨湿着——门把烫得像刚被她捂过。免费只够停在几乎。",
          "advance": "n_w3_edge_lock_mia",
          "assetId": "assets/scenes/w3/n_w3_02a_mia.webp",
          "artCue": "门把吊Mia",
          "artStatus": "placeholder",
          "characters": [
            "kai",
            "mia"
          ],
          "camera": "close",
          "transition": "soft-zoom",
          "fx": "tension_hold",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "走廊灯把她影子拉长。旧 T 恤领口扯大一指，锁骨亮着薄汗——门缝里涌出未散的热。",
              "camera": "close",
              "transition": "soft-zoom",
              "fx": "tension_hold"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "mia",
              "text": "「进不进。——别装听不见。」",
              "camera": "close_alt",
              "transition": "softZoomCrop",
              "fx": "breath"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "你的手搭上门把——金属发烫，像刚被她捂过。呼吸打在你腕侧；免费只够停在几乎。",
              "camera": "close_hand",
              "transition": "softZoomCrop",
              "fx": "warm-veil"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "n_w3_02a_jade",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "tier": "free",
          "text": "Jade 门口。演出后的衣料还乱，肩带挂着——门把烫得像刚被她捂过。免费只够停在几乎。",
          "advance": "n_w3_edge_lock_jade",
          "assetId": "assets/scenes/w3/n_w3_02a_jade.webp",
          "artCue": "门把吊Jade",
          "artStatus": "placeholder",
          "characters": [
            "kai",
            "jade"
          ],
          "camera": "close",
          "transition": "soft-zoom",
          "fx": "tension_hold",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "门缝里涌出香水与未散的热。肩带挂着，衣料还乱——她把你钉在门槛这一寸。",
              "camera": "close",
              "transition": "soft-zoom",
              "fx": "tension_hold"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "jade",
              "text": "「推，还是装没事。——选一个。」",
              "camera": "close_alt",
              "transition": "softZoomCrop",
              "fx": "breath"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "你的手搭上门把，热意从金属爬上手心。她目光不停——免费只够停在几乎。",
              "camera": "close_hand",
              "transition": "softZoomCrop",
              "fx": "warm-veil"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "n_w3_edge_lock_mia",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "gate": "edge_lock",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "tier": "free",
          "text": "门还没开。门把烫得像刚被她捂过——Mia 的热气在门缝里，像一声没说完的「进来」。免费吊够烫。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "choiceId": "c_leave",
              "text": "离开。——带着门把上的热。软退，账单会记。",
              "next": "n_w3_soft_end",
              "delta": {},
              "gateChoice": "free",
              "meta": {
                "statusHint": {
                  "axis": "none",
                  "delta": 0
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "choiceId": "c_push",
              "text": "接招：推门进去。——看 Mia 把门锁合上之后。她骂你胆子大，却又让开半步。",
              "next": "n_w3_02b_mia",
              "delta": {},
