          "fx": "breath",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "门锁合上——咔。金属轻响像判决：外面的世界被切掉。",
              "camera": "close_hand",
              "transition": "dip",
              "fx": "breath"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "mia",
              "text": "「……Kai。」——旧称呼卡在喉咙，没叫全。",
              "camera": "close_alt",
              "transition": "softZoomCrop",
              "fx": "breath"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "她背靠门，呼吸乱。空间只够两个人的体温——锁已合，下一步才是留不留。",
              "camera": "close",
              "transition": "softZoomCrop",
              "fx": "warm-veil"
